# Hollow (Necromancy) spell names + descriptions.
spell-cause_fear = Cause Fear
spell-cause_fear-desc = You stir a sudden, gnawing dread of death in one creature within sight, gripping it with fear of you. The undying and the soulless feel nothing of this terror.
spell-bestow_curse = Bestow Curse
spell-bestow_curse-desc = With a baleful touch you lay a withering hex on a single creature, sapping its body and fortune for as long as you hold focus.
spell-blindness_deafness = Blindness/Deafness
spell-blindness_deafness-desc = A jolt of withering force lances toward a single creature in sight, robbing it of its sight unless its body resists. The afflicted sense goes dark for a short while.
spell-contagion = Contagion
spell-contagion-desc = A festering sickness gathers in your hand; strike a creature within reach to seed the affliction in its flesh. If the blow lands, the malady takes hold and leaves the victim wracked and weakened.
spell-eyebite_asleep = Eyebite (Sleep)
spell-eyebite_asleep-desc = Your gaze turns baleful, and you fix it on one creature within sight. If its will falters, a magical slumber drops it where it stands for as long as you hold focus.
spell-eyebite_panicked = Eyebite (Panic)
spell-eyebite_panicked-desc = Your gaze turns baleful, and you fix it on one creature within sight. If its will falters, terror seizes it and it flees for as long as you hold focus.
spell-eyebite_sickened = Eyebite (Sicken)
spell-eyebite_sickened-desc = Your gaze turns baleful, and you fix it on one creature within sight. If its will falters, a wasting sickness saps its focus and wracks its body for as long as you hold focus.

spell-dread_whisper = Dread Whisper
spell-dread_whisper-desc = You breathe a whisper laced with the dread of the grave toward a foe, the psychic blast rattling their mind with terror. Drawing on power from Beyond always exacts its own toll, leaving you a little more hollow than before.

spell-chill_touch = Chill Touch
spell-chill_touch-desc = You conjure a spectral, grave-cold hand that lunges at a distant foe, draining its vitality with a chilling grip. The withering touch leaves the victim's wounds aching and slow to close.
spell-poison_spray = Poison Spray
spell-poison_spray-desc = You fling a burst of caustic vapor at a single foe within reach. A successful ranged spell attack sears the target with venomous corrosion.
spell-spare_the_dying = Spare the Dying
spell-spare_the_dying-desc = A touch of steadying light halts a dying ally on the brink, anchoring their failing spark so it no longer slips away. It does nothing for the undead or the soulless.
spell-toll_the_dead = Toll the Dead
spell-toll_the_dead-desc = You point at a foe and a mournful toll resounds about it. The target resists with willpower or is wracked by withering necrotic energy, suffering greater harm if already wounded.
spell-false_life = False Life
spell-false_life-desc = You wrap yourself in a hollow shimmer of borrowed vitality, gaining a buffer of temporary vigor that absorbs harm. The false animation fades once the energy is spent or the spell expires.
spell-inflict_wounds = Inflict Wounds
spell-inflict_wounds-desc = You channel withering death-magic into a single touched foe, tearing at their vitality. A successful strike sears the target with a surge of necrotic decay.
spell-ray_of_sickness = Ray of Sickness
spell-ray_of_sickness-desc = A lance of sickly green energy streaks toward one creature; on a hit it suffers a burst of poisonous corruption and may be wracked with nausea if it fails to resist.
